  // Plasma impact (2026-07-30): the hottest thing in the mod. +90 lights any
  // fuel in the engine from cold in a single hit (core:wood ignites at 80
  // from a 20 ambient; jungle timber at 80 from an ambient 0). The limit is
  // core:lava's spawn temperature, so a sustained plasma barrage is the one
